<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Pemex details product exports, imports.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Pemex details product exports, imports.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's oil and gas monopoly Petroleos Mexicanos (Pemex) reported its exports and imports of crude oil, oil products, natural gas and chemicals for the first nine months. Figures in millions of dollars.</p>
<p>  Item		First Nine Mos. 1995   First Nine Mos. 1996</p>
<p>  Balance			 5,565		     7,188</p>
<p>	Exports		   6,488		     8,258</p>
<p>	Imports		     923		     1,070</p>
<p>  Crude Exports		 5,746		     7,614</p>
<p>Oil Products</p>
<p>	Exports		     360			 250</p>
<p>	Imports		     820		     1,004</p>
<p>Natural Gas</p>
<p>	Exports			 9			  25</p>
<p>	Imports			81			  49</p>
<p>Chemicals</p>
<p>	Exports		     373			 369</p>
<p>	Import			 22			  17</p>
<p>--Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom +525 7287903</p>
</text>
